  "summary_en": "Mandatory all-of-government policy for NSW agencies on AI use, replacing the NSW AI Ethics Policy and adopting Australia's AI Ethics Principles. It sets accountability and acceptable-use standards, AI use case registration, risk-band assessment under the AI Assessment Framework, attestation and incident reporting. It has no robotics-specific content.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Applies to all NSW Government sector agencies and statutory bodies; replaces NSW AI Ethics Policy",
   "Agency Heads must appoint an Accountable Official and set up governance and assurance functions",
   "All AI use cases must be registered on the AIAF Platform, with risk bands assigned",
   "Standard B sets mandatory acceptable-use principles, including human or non-AI alternative channels",
   "Agencies must attest compliance annually and report AI incidents"
